From 031303e7864a8038a0019ddea081d71d6f4d9a02 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wwqgtxx <wwqgtxx@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 06:39:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: add an embedding DNS lookup hook

Embedded Tailscale needs to resolve control and relay hosts through the
application's resolver. Thread an optional lookup hook through its DNS
clients and retain lookup errors without falling back to other resolvers.

Port MetaCubeX/tailscale ab8269766d9e62deebd7320368c9b567e6fb6b63
with canonical tailscale.com and standard crypto/tls imports. Preserve
the hook's fallback semantics and tests.
---
